  "coverage_argument": "C5 is non-empty. A paid-source or constant driver excludes every other driver; a singleton component has one ancestor count. A multi-driver C5 bus contains only Switch outputs. For d selected Switch drivers, physical-net partition makes them mutually independent, so all component ancestors can be ordered first, the d drivers next, and every non-ancestor last. The weighted bound implies d <= min(components, gate_bound-components)."
